Generated by `Notes/deligne/campaign/generators/gen_finite_cert.py e7`. Imports only the Boolean
certificate checks (`DeligneFusionFiniteGCert`) and the data tables, not the sector stack
(the light-import pattern); `DeligneFusionFiniteGE7` bridges to `E7sector` by definitional
unfolding.
